<p>Salami Jaa'n gaza Hai Ranj&ndash;O-Gham Qaasaan-E Dawar Ka<br />
Qalaq Sibtain Ka, Zehra Ka, Hyder Ka, Payambar Ka<br />
________________________________________</p>

<p>Sadaa Shohra Rahega Judh-O Khulqo Zor-E Hyder Ka<br />
Qataar-O Shair-O Angushtar Ka, Darkaaroh Ke Par Ka<br />
________________________________________</p>

<p>Ali Ki Tegh Ke Dam Se Huwa Har Mareka Faisal<br />
Ohad Ka, Badr Ka, Siffin Ka, Qandaq Ka, Qaibar Ka<br />
________________________________________</p>

<p>Ye Paancho'n Soore hai jo Panjatan Ki Shaan Me Aaye<br />
