________________________________________</p>

<p>Hamare Waste Sheh Ne Gawara Kar Liya Mitna<br />
Haram Ka, Aabru Ka, Jaan Ka, Aulaad Ka, Ghar Ka<br />
________________________________________</p>

<p>Sakina Legayi Ye Paanch Daagh Is Baaghe Aalam Se<br />
Tamachoun Ka, Rasan Ka, Baap Ka, Saqqe Ka, Gouhar Ka<br />
________________________________________</p>

<p>Ghazab Hai Itne Sadme ek Jaan Qwaahare Sheh Par<br />
